# el-i2-270: 3 s holds at throttle 0, with 0.5 s sweeps between them.
hold 1400 0 3
sweep 1400 2000 0 0.5
hold 2000 0 3
sweep 2000 3000 0 0.5
hold 3000 0 3
sweep 3000 4000 0 0.5
hold 4000 0 3
sweep 4000 5000 0 0.5
hold 5000 0 3
sweep 5000 6000 0 0.5
hold 6000 0 3
sweep 6000 7000 0 0.5
hold 7000 0 3
sweep 7000 8000 0 0.5
hold 8000 0 3
sweep 8000 9000 0 0.5
hold 9000 0 3
sweep 9000 10000 0 0.5
hold 10000 0 3
